# [OOS] Gap 1 names the step-5 bash wrapper; the plan only exercises review-and-fix step5 --difficulty
## Out-of-Scope Observation
**Surfaced by**: Cursor-Arch
**Phase**: design
## Description
Gap 1 names the step-5 bash wrapper; the plan only exercises review-and-fix step5 --difficulty. Scenario: A regression that drops DIFFICULTY_OVERRIDE forwarding in step-5-review.sh would not be caught. The mapping under test is still covered at the CLI boundary.
---
*This issue was automatically created by the larch `/design` workflow from an out-of-scope observation surfaced during plan review.*
## Out-of-Scope Observation
**Surfaced by**: Cursor-Arch
**Phase**: design
## Description
